up an AP turret and hack through security? If you answered yes, your team could probably use you as an Engineer.<br></li><li>Demolitionists come in very handy when you need large shield generators and enemy vehicles to simply stop existing.  <br></li><li>Does your team suck? Teamwork is overrated anyway. Take on the Assassin class and show everyone what being a loner is all about. </li></ul>",
